# Build artifacts
#
# Note: these patterns must be anchored to the repository root with a leading /. A bare
# `spclust` entry used to be here, and patterns without a slash match a path component at
# **any depth**, so include/spclust/ was ignored entirely and the public header was never committed.
/spclust
/spclust-asan
/spclust-linkage-*
/libspclust.a
/cut_property
/c_api_test
/libspclust.so
/hac.o
/build/
/build-*/
*.dSYM/
*.o

# Python
__pycache__/
